# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0 — https://citation-file-format.github.io).
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository"; Zenodo reads it on archive.
# Version and release date track the latest PyPI release (2.15.0, 2026-08-16).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use awesomepkf in published work, please cite the software itself
  by this file and the companion paper below.
type: software
title: "awesomepkf"
abstract: >-
  Python library for pairwise Kalman filtering and smoothing on Gaussian
  pairwise Markov models: linear pairwise Kalman filter (PKF), nonlinear
  extensions (EPKF, UPKF, pairwise particle filter), linear smoothers,
  EM learning and back-action tests.
authors:
